SUMMARY:🧭 Europe trip — 2-weeks-out final review
DESCRIPTION:Playbook checklist: re-verify every venue's hours/closed-days/closures for our dates; confirm all reservations & timed tickets are booked + saved offline; swap weather averages for the live forecast; buy insurance if not done; install eSIM; download offline maps.\n\nNEW (Sept re-route): install MOBILE PASSPORT CONTROL (free CBP app) for both of you before departure - you now clear US customs at PHILADELPHIA on the way home (Nov 25), not Charlotte, and MPC skips most of the immigration queue. Also: the return lands Tampa 11:51 PM, the night before Thanksgiving - sort out parking or a pickup.\n\n--\nTHIS REMINDER REPEATS EVERY 2 DAYS until its deadline. Subscribed calendars are read-only, so iOS won't offer Snooze -- just dismiss it and it will come back. Once you've actually done this one, tell Claude and it gets removed from the feed for good.
